9%9D%A2%22%2C%22count%22%3A7%2C%22url%22%3A%22%2Fbh3%2Fwiki%2Fcontent%2F1273%2Fdetail%22%7D%5D%7D%2C%7B%22level%22%3A%2240%22%2C%22material%22%3A%5B%7B%22name%22%3A%22%E9%AD%82%E8%9A%80%E7%8E%89%22%2C%22count%22%3A330%2C%22url%22%3A%22%2Fbh3%2Fwiki%2Fcontent%2F1191%2Fdetail%22%7D%2C%7B%22name%22%3A%22%E7%9B%B8%E8%BD%AC%E7%A7%BB%E9%95%9C%E9%9D%A2%22%2C%22count%22%3A15%2C%22url%22%3A%22%2Fbh3%2Fwiki%2Fcontent%2F1273%2Fdetail%22%7D%5D%7D%2C%7B%22level%22%3A%2245%22%2C%22material%22%3A%5B%7B%22name%22%3A%22%E9%AD%82%E8%9A%80%E7%8E%89%22%2C%22count%22%3A720%2C%22url%22%3A%22%2Fbh3%2Fwiki%2Fcontent%2F1191%2Fdetail%22%7D%2C%7B%22name%22%3A%22%E7%9B%B8%E8%BD%AC%E7%A7%BB%E9%95%9C%E9%9D%A2%22%2C%22count%22%3A18%2C%22url%22%3A%22%2Fbh3%2Fwiki%2Fcontent%2F1273%2Fdetail%22%7D%5D%7D%5D%7D%7D%5D\" data-ts=\"1730880123196\" data-col-type=\"l2r1\"><div style=\"order: 0;\"> <div data-part=\"info\" data-tmpl=\"weapon\" class=\"obc-tmpl__part obc-tmpl-weapon obc-tmpl__part--info obc-tmpl__part--align-banner\"><h1>武器数据</h1> <table class=\"obc-tmpl__gain-method obc-tmpl-weapon__info-table\"><colgroup><col> <col> <col></colgroup> <tbody><tr><td rowspan=\"3\" class=\"obc-tmpl-weapon__info-avatar\"><img src=\"https://uploadstatic.mihoyo.com/bh3-wiki/2021/09/10/75940953/28843d9f0eec24c84c8aacd188cd058c_1512095342421866327.png\" alt=\"\"></td> <td class=\"h3\">星级</td> <td colspan=\"5\"><div class=\"obc-tmpl-weapon__info-stars\"><i class=\"obc-tmpl__rate-icon\"></i><i class=\"obc-tmpl__rate-icon\"></i><i class=\"obc-tmpl__rate-icon\"></i><i class=\"obc-tmpl__rate-icon\"></i><i class=\"obc-tmpl__rate-icon\"></i></div></td></tr> <tr><td class=\"h3\">攻击</td> <td colspan=\"5\" class=\"obc-tmpl__rich-text\">270</td></tr><tr><td class=\"h3\">会心</td> <td colspan=\"5\" class=\"obc-tmpl__rich-text\">33</td></tr></tbody></table> <div class=\"obc-tmpl-weapon__info-desc\"><p style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\">破坏之键「天火圣裁」完全解放力量后，所显现的形态。双枪伸展变形，构成剑柄。熔金般的高热烈焰冲天而起，凝聚成剑身。如其名所示，为万物带来平等的毁灭。</p></div> <!----></div></div><div style=\"order: 1;\"> <div data-part=\"skill\" data-tmpl=\"weapon\" class=\"obc-tmpl__part obc-tmpl-weapon obc-tmpl__part--skill obc-tmpl__part--align-banner\"><h2>武器技能</h2> <table class=\"obc-tmpl__gain-method\"><colgroup><col> <col></colgroup> <tbody><tr><td class=\"h3\">劫火</td> <td colspan=\"5\" class=\"obc-tmpl__rich-text\"><p style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\">[能量消耗:20][冷却:20秒]消耗生命爆发天火大剑的力量，角色普通攻击，分支攻击，蓄力攻击，必杀攻击击中时，0.5秒内每击附加500点火焰元素伤害，冷却时间0.3秒；释放技能后每秒消耗最大生命的2%，如果当前生命不足最大生命50%时则每秒消耗最大生命的1%，该技能持续10秒，角色不会因此效果死亡</p></td></tr><tr><td class=\"h3\">涅槃</td> <td colspan=\"5\" class=\"obc-tmpl__rich-text\"><p style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\">角色造成的全伤害提高13.0%；当前生命值低于最大生命值的50%时，角色受到的全伤害减少15%，且每秒回复15.0点生命值</p></td></tr><tr><td class=\"h3\">破坏之键</td> <td colspan=\"5\" class=\"obc-tmpl__rich-text\"><p style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\">在联机Raid关卡中，角色使用武器主动技能后，全队造成的全伤害提高20%，自身每秒回复7.0%的生命值，持续5.1秒</p></td></tr></tbody></table> <!----></div></div><div style=\"order: 2;\"> <div data-part=\"gainMethod\" data-tmpl=\"general\" class=\"obc-tmpl__part obc-tmpl-general obc-tmpl__part--gainMethod obc-tmpl__part--align-banner\"><h2>获取途径</h2> <table class=\"obc-tmpl__gain-method\"><colgroup><col> <col></colgroup> <tbody><tr><td class=\"h3\">拓境战幕</td> <td colspan=\"5\" class=\"obc-tmpl__rich-text\"><p style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\">通过拓境战幕玩法获取<span data-type=\"详情\" data-name=\"&lt;p style=&quot;white-space: pre-wrap;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:rgba(24,144,255,1)&quot;&gt;神之键领取计数规则：&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;white-space: pre-wrap;&quot;&gt;·每获得一期活动中的6个挑战之星即可从以下列表中自选一件未获得过的神之键领取：&lt;br&gt;「天火圣裁」/「地藏御魂 」/「太虚之握」/「 天火大剑 」/「 伊甸之星」&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;white-space: pre-wrap;&quot;&gt;·领取次数可以累计，不会每周清空&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;white-space: pre-wrap;&quot;&gt;·领取次数最大不超过列表中未获得的神之键数量&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;white-space: pre-wrap;&quot;&gt;·此页面内所有神之键领取完成后，此页面入口将会关闭&lt;/p&gt;\" class=\"wiki-note-text\"><sup class=\"wiki-sup\">[详情]</sup></s